[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 18360.31, "timestamp": "05:06:00", "text": "是的。太可怕了。嗯嗯，如果这个我们……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18362.31, "timestamp": "05:06:02", "text": "找人代笔写这本书？你……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18365.868, "timestamp": "05:06:05", "text": "把书放好吗？是的，我放了书。我放"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18369.51, "timestamp": "05:06:09", "text": "书。但是，呃，目前还没有开始写作。还没有。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18394.31, "timestamp": "05:06:34", "text": "所以，你最近没怎么看直播，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18398.628, "timestamp": "05:06:38", "text": "不，我没有。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18401.35, "timestamp": "05:06:41", "text": "人生总会发生各种各样的事情，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18412.628, "timestamp": "05:06:52", "text": "呃，我们是不是该拿些蜡烛、香之类的东西？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 18414.948, "timestamp": "05:06:54", "text": "盐？哦，是的。你放盐了吧？"}]